	'Now it\'s up to you: Are you ready to delve into the horrifying world of ZombVival?',
  'Ist das eine Machete in deiner Hose, oder freust du dich nur auf die Zombies?' =>
	'Is that a machete in your pants, or are you just happy to meet some zombies?',
